00-veggie-caps/117702\"},{\"title\":\"- Vegetarian/vegan\",\"url\":\"https://swansonvitamins.com/products/now-foods-cayenne-100-caps\"},{\"title\":\"commercial product\",\"url\":\"https://naturalmedicines.therapeuticresearch.com/databases/commercial-products/commercial-product.aspx?cpid=93606\"},{\"title\":\"NOW Foods NOW Foods Cayenne 500mg\",\"url\":\"https://well.ca/products/now-foods-cayenne-500mg_19453.html\"},{\"title\":\"Cayenne Extract (Capsicum) - 90,000 Heat Units - 450 MG (100 Capsules)\",\"url\":\"https://www.vitaminshoppe.com/p/cayenne-extract-450-mg-100-capsules/vs-1786\"},{\"title\":\"Taxes and shipping calculated at checkout\",\"url\":\"https://girlboss.com/a/blog/best-cayenne-pepper-supplement\"}]\n\nSeveral brands sell cayenne capsules. The most common ones in these results are NOW Foods, Swanson, Solaray, Nature's Truth, and The Vitamin Shoppe.\n\n- **NOW Foods:** Its 500 mg veg capsules are a cayenne pepper (Capsicum annuum) product listed at 40,000 heat units, sold in 100-count bottles. The brand also sells a 250-count version.\n- **Swanson:** It offers a 450 mg cayenne capsule, and its \"Super Cayenne\" blend includes ginger and hawthorn berry. Its directions suggest taking the capsules with meals to help reduce stomach warmth from cayenne.\n- **Solaray:** It sells cayenne capsules in 450 mg and 515 mg strengths, and one listing highlights a Bio-Cool process meant to make the product gentler on the stomach.\n- **Nature's Truth:** Its Ultra Max Cayenne Plus Ginger Root capsules are 450 mg of Cayenne Pepper plus 210 mg of Ginger and 210 mg of Hawthorn.\n- **The Vitamin Shoppe:** Its 450 mg cayenne extract is a capsule with no heat-related sensation, and the brand says its dietary ingredients are tested for identity, purity, strength, composition and known contaminants.\n- **Other options:** Spring Valley (Walmart's house brand) sells a 455 mg, 100-count version at a lower price. Pure Original Ingredients and Nature's Way are also mentioned in review articles.\n\nThe results don't rank these brands by quality or independent testing. Product pages and review articles are the main sources, so check each label for dosage, heat units, and any added ingredients before buying.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d837e3d5-d0ab-4a5f-986c-291ebe96c2c0","uuid":"16986109-05ec-4eb8-9722-6eb100f3cac6","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:01:00.882Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"cayenne pepper capsules supplement brand","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_018McwCeyGF3CayLWdd5YBXy","content":[{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/108316320"},{"title":"skip to main content","url":"https://www.target.com/s/cayenne+pepper+capsules?Nao=864"},{"title":"skip to main content","url":"https://www.target.com/s/cayenne+pepper+capsules?Nao=816"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/179105180"},{"title":"skip to main content","url":"https://www.target.com/s/cayenne+pepper+capsules?Nao=1080"},{"title":"skip to main content","url":"https://www.target.com/s/cayenne+pepper+capsules?Nao=792"},{"title":"www.walmart.com","url":"https://www.walmart.com/ip/NOW-Supplements-Cayenne-Capsicum-annuum-500-mg-250-Capsules/223195947"},{"title":"NOW Cayenne 500 mg","url":"https://naturalgrocers.instacart.com/store/natural-grocers/products/1291215-now-cayenne-500-mg-veg-capsules-100-ea"},{"title":"Nature's Truth, Ultra Max Cayenne Plus Ginger Root, 100 Quick-Release Capsules","url":"https://au.iherb.com/pr/nature-s-truth-ultra-max-cayenne-plus-ginger-root-100-quick-release-capsules/127604"},{"title":"Nature's Truth, Ultra Max Cayenne Plus Ginger Root, 100 Quick Release Capsules","url":"https://gh.iherb.com/pr/nature-s-truth-ultra-max-cayenne-plus-ginger-root-100-quick-release-capsules/127604"},{"title":"Nature's Truth, Ultra Max Cayenne Plus Ginger Root, 100 Quick Release Capsules","url":"https://ae.iherb.c